  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Raising Global Standards of Aid Transparency</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To improve the transparency of international aid data in line with international standards, so that governments and citizens can gain access to and use aid information to hold decision makers to account.   The programme will strengthen the main global aid transparency standard setting body, and support assessment and monitoring of UK and other organisations&#x2019; transparency performance with appropriate tools and guidance.</narrative>
  </description>
